# Frontend (`src/`)

**Framework:** SvelteKit + `@sveltejs/adapter-static` → `build/`, served by FastAPI as SPA.

## Routing (`src/routes/`)

- `(app)/` — authenticated layout: `home/`, `workspace/`, `admin/`, `c/` (chat), `notes/`, `calendar/`, `channels/`, `playground/`, `automations/`
- `auth/` — login/signup/SSO
- `s/` — shared public chats
- `watch/` — WebRTC watch page

## Key directories

- `src/lib/stores/index.ts` — `user`, `config`, `socket`, `theme`, `chatId`, `mobile`, `WEBUI_NAME`
- `src/lib/apis/` — typed REST clients; `streaming/` for SSE/WebSocket
- `src/lib/components/` — domain trees: `chat/`, `layout/`, `common/`, `admin/`, `workspace/`, etc.
- `src/lib/i18n/` — i18next; locales in `locales/`; run `npm run i18n:parse` for new keys

## Theming & branding

- **Color tokens (Tailwind v4):** defined in `src/tailwind.css` `@theme` — `primary-*` (Monet Purple `#9181bd`), `accent-*` (sakura `#ec6a9c`), and warm-purple-retinted `gray-*`. Use `primary-*`/`accent-*`, not raw `blue-*`. Dark runtime overrides live in `chat/Settings/General.svelte` (`applyTheme`) and `app.html` — keep them aligned to the `@theme` oklch values to avoid a first-paint flash.
- **`/static/` path mapping (gotcha):** dev serves it from `static/static/`; the backend from `STATIC_DIR = backend/open_webui/static`. `static/brand/` is the canonical brand-asset source. Browsers prefer `favicon.svg`. Update icons in all three.
- **Onboarding/auth branding:** `OnBoarding.svelte` + `auth/+page.svelte` use a theme-aware sakura background (`/assets/images/sakura-{dark,light}.png`). Brand-system source of truth is the center docs (`../sub2api/sakrylle-docs/40-brand-system/`); product-local status in `oidc-docs/implementation-status.md`.
